{
  "uid": "eurotransit-kafka",
  "title": "EuroTransit — Kafka consumer lag",
  "tags": ["eurotransit", "kafka", "lag"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "consumergroup",
        "label": "Consumer group",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(kafka_consumergroup_lag, consumergroup)",
        "definition": "label_values(kafka_consumergroup_lag, consumergroup)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Prerequisite",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Empty panels?** This dashboard needs a consumer-lag source. Either enable the Strimzi **kafka-exporter** on the Kafka CR (exposes `kafka_consumergroup_lag`) and scrape it, or enable the apps' **Micrometer Kafka binder** (`kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag`, already scraped via our ServiceMonitors). Consumer lag is the leading indicator of pipeline latency — it rises before user-visible delay."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (records) by group — kafka-exporter",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (consumergroup) (kafka_consumergroup_lag{consumergroup=~\"$consumergroup\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (records) by topic — kafka-exporter",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (kafka_consumergroup_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag (records) — Micrometer binder (alt source)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max by (job, topic) (kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} / {{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
